
*
* gfx.sm - Graphics system file
*
* The contents of this file are used by autoconfig when configuring /1 .
* See system(4) for information on the syntax of this file.
*
* $Revision: 1.57 $
*

*
*  Input drivers
*
INCLUDE: shmiq idev
INCLUDE: mouse keyboard
* these are not needed (or wanted, for size reasons) in the miniroot
* normally they are loadable, but miniroot is a forced link.
USE : dial dialbox sball tablet calcomp hitachi imp magellan wacom
*
*     Machine dependent
*
*
* gr2 - Extreme, XZ
* ng1 - Indy, and XL
*
USE: ng1
USE: gr2
USE: mgras

*
*  Textport drivers
*
INCLUDE: tport
INCLUDE: tportpckbd
* everybody supports htport since IRIX 6.2
INCLUDE: htport
*
*  Graphics drivers
*
*     Machine independent modules
*     gfx must be last in this file, so that the kernel will call it first
*
USE: gfxs rrm xconn
USE: gfx 
